OL,3,ACeremony begins to mark 25th
OL,4,Aanniversary of 9/11 at site of World
OL,5,ATrade Center in New York
OL,6,
OL,7,FA memorial ceremony is under way at the
OL,8,Fsite of New York's World Trade Center
OL,9,Fas the US marks the 25th anniversary of
OL,10,Fthe 9/11 attacks
OL,12,FThe assembled crowd has observed the
OL,13,Ffirst of seven moments of silence - six
OL,14,Fto mark the times the planes crashed
OL,15,Fand buildings fell, and the seventh to
OL,16,Fhonour those who have since died from
OL,17,F9/11-related illnesses
OL,19,FVice-President JD Vance, former New
OL,20,FYork Mayor Rudy Giuliani as well as
OL,21,Fformer Presidents Joe Biden and Barak
OL,22,FObama are attending the commemoration
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
