OL,3,ACeremony begins to mark 25th
OL,4,Aanniversary of 9/11 at site of World
OL,5,ATrade Center in New York
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn 11 September 2001, 2,977 people were
OL,8,Fkilled when hijackers crashed two
OL,9,Fplanes into the Twin Towers of the
OL,10,FWorld Trade Center
OL,12,FAnother hijacked plane hit the Pentagon
OL,13,Fnear Washington DC. A fourth crashed in
OL,14,Fa field in Pennsylvania after
OL,15,Fpassengers fought back
